     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The odds in favor of <span data-math=\"E\"></span> are <span data-math=\"{\\text{4:9}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>If the odds in favor of <span data-math=\"E\"></span> are <span data-math=\"A:B\"></span>, then</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"P(E)\\; = \\frac{A}{{A + B}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"P(E)\\; = \\frac{A}{{A + B}} = \\frac{4}{{4 + 9}} = \\frac{4}{{13}}\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
